00:04:57.964 --> 00:04:58.998
-Yeah, I'll definitely
check it out.

00:04:58.998 --> 00:05:00.065
I love that, man.

00:05:00.065 --> 00:05:01.900
But then here's what
I love about you.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.703
